DESCRIPTION:Dabeull is a visionary French producer and artist\, widely rega
 
rded as a leading figure in the global funk revival. With his unmistakable 
 
blend of punchy basslines\, retro synthesizers\, and sensual vocals\, he ha
 
s carved out an unique place on the international music scene. Known for hi
 
s 70s?80s movie star aesthetic and analog obsession\, Dabeull channels the 
 
golden era of funk with unmatched authenticity. His sound is deeply influen
 
ced by the Pop\, Funk and African Music he was exposed to during his youth\
 
, infused with the warmth of vintage gear and recorded entirely using class
 
ic 70s synthesizers. Whether in the studio or on stage\, Dabeull is a maste
 
r of groove. His live shows?featuring a full analog band\, period costumes\
 
, and retro instrumentation?transport audiences on a nostalgic\, feel-good 
 
journey through funk history.With a growing global fanbase and a distinct a
 
rtistic identity\, Dabeull continues to redefine modern funk while honoring
 
 its timeless roots. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/dabeull
 
-london-05-11-2026/event/3E00649DB4542E50
